                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele tuleelede kulumba Leza lyoonse aandinywe, nobakwesu abayandwa ku-Mwami, kuti Leza wakamusalulula kuzwa kumatalikilo, kuti mutambule lufutuko mukusalazigwa kunguzu zya-Muuya amukusyoma lusinizyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
